---
import clockTowerImage from '@/assets/clock-tower.jpg';
import clockTowerImageWebp from '@/assets/clock-tower.webp';
---

<section class="section-content">
  <h2 class="section-title">What is EB-5 for international students?</h2>

  <p class="section-text">
    The EB-5 Immigrant Investor Program gives eligible foreign nationals a path to a U.S. green card through a qualifying investment in a U.S. commercial enterprise. For international students graduating in the USA, EB-5 gives a path to permanent residence without employer sponsorship or the H-1B lottery. See the <a href="/eb5-green-card-international-students-playbook" class="text-primary font-semibold underline underline-offset-4">International Student Playbook</a> for a full guide.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">What is the EB-5 Investor Visa Program?</h2>

  <p class="section-text">
    Congress created the EB-5 Immigrant Investor Program in 1990. A qualifying investment can support a green card for the investor, a spouse, and unmarried children under 21. Many international students use EB-5 when they face immigration deadlines or uncertainty.
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 section-text space-y-2">
    <li>H1B uncertainty</li>
    <li>visa dependency</li>
    <li>green card backlogs</li>
    <li>OPT end-date risk</li>
    <li>green card acquisition without employer sponsorship</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="section-text">
    We work closely with clients seeking long-term immigration stability and employer-independent permanent residency solutions tailored to their personal and professional goals.
  </p>

  <p class="section-text">
    Student EB-5 provides personalized support, strategic guidance, and in-depth analysis throughout the EB-5 process. Our team is highly experienced in assisting:
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 section-text space-y-2">
    <li>International students exploring long-term immigration options after graduation</li>
    <li>Tech professionals using EB-5 as a backup immigration strategy amid H-1B uncertainty and Green Card backlogs</li>
    <li>Families seeking long-term residency security and greater immigration stability in the United States</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-foreground mt-12 mb-6">Your Path to U.S. Permanent Residency Starts Now</h2>

  <p class="section-text">
    Student EB-5 is a U.S.-based platform connected with experienced EB-5 regional centers, EB-5 attorneys, immigration advisors, and industry professionals to provide international students and foreign professionals with the most comprehensive approach to the EB-5 process. We specialize in helping F1 students, H-1B professionals, STEM graduates, and global families navigate complex immigration challenges including H-1B uncertainty, green card backlog, OPT expiration concerns, and the search for a green card without employer sponsorship.
  </p>

  <p class="section-text">
    Our primary focus is supporting international students and young professionals because this group has been historically underserved in the investment immigration space. We work with students and professionals around the world who are planning to study, work, and build long-term futures in the United States while exploring pathways to permanent residency through investment. <a href="/pathways" class="text-primary hover:underline">Choose Your EB-5 Pathway</a> based on your current visa status.
  </p>

  <p class="section-text">
    Understanding EB-5 visa requirements, concurrent filing, rural EB-5 projects, processing timelines (<a href="/tools/grandfathering-countdown" class="text-primary hover:underline">Grandfathering Countdown</a>), source of funds, and investment options (<a href="/tools/2026-eb5-investment-feasibility-calculator" class="text-primary hover:underline">EB-5 Investment Feasibility Calculator</a>) can be overwhelming. Review the <a href="/eb5-investment-process" class="text-primary hover:underline">Step-by-Step EB-5 Process</a> and our <a href="/eb5-investment-immigration-tools" class="text-primary hover:underline">Free EB-5 Calculators</a>. We hope to provide detailed <a href="/resources" class="text-primary hover:underline">resources</a>, <a href="/research" class="text-primary hover:underline">EB-5 Research</a>, and strategic guidance so clients can make informed decisions about their immigration future.
  </p>

  <picture>
    <source srcset={clockTowerImageWebp.src} type="image/webp" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 637px" />
    <source srcset={clockTowerImage.src} type="image/jpeg" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 637px" />
    <img
      src={clockTowerImage.src}
      alt="Historic clock tower representing American heritage and future opportunities"
      class="section-image"
      loading="lazy"
      width={637}
      height={958}
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="low"
    />
  </picture>
</section>
